          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリの時間を積む"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリの選択、まだ取り込んでいない利用記録、黒い石をこのiPhoneから削除し、自動記録を停止して、集中中のアプリ制限もオフにします。取り消せません。保存済みの勉強時間と粒は残ります。" : {
      "comment" : "Screen Time reset confirmation. The reset also switches the focus shield (集中中のアプリ制限) off.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This deletes your app selection, usage not yet added, and black stones from this iPhone, stops recording, and turns off app blocking during focus. This can't be undone. Study time and gems you already saved are kept."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリの選択、まだ取り込んでいない利用記録、黒い石をこのiPhoneから削除し、自動記録を停止して、集中中のアプリ制限もオフにします。取り消せません。保存済みの勉強時間と粒は残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリの選択、未取り込みの利用記録、黒い石は、このiPhoneだけに保存します。JSON書き出しや保存先の切り替えでは引き継ぎません。" : {
      "comment" : "About recording: device-local data",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your app selection, usage not yet added, and black stones are saved only on this iPhone. They aren't included in JSON exports or carried over when you switch storage."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリの選択、未取り込みの利用記録、黒い石は、このiPhoneだけに保存します。JSON書き出しや保存先の切り替えでは引き継ぎません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリの選択・未取り込みの利用記録・黒い石を削除し、自動記録を停止して、集中中のアプリ制限もオフにします。保存済みの勉強時間と粒は残ります。" : {
      "comment" : "Footer under the full Screen Time reset. The reset also switches the focus shield (集中中のアプリ制限) off.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletes your app selection, usage not yet added, and black stones, stops recording, and turns off app blocking during focus. Study time and gems you already saved are kept."
          }
